  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Each box contains <math><mn>10</mn></math> balls numbered from <math><mn>1</mn></math> to <math><mn>10</mn></math>.</p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> are numbers on the balls drawn from the box <math><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>i.e., all <math><mn>3</mn></math> numbers <math><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> must be different and can be arranged only in one way (increasing).</p><p>Now <math><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> can be selected in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow/><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> ways.</p><p>Hence, total number of ways <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
